    <li>attempt to circumvent platform access controls;</li>
    <li>scrape, extract, or build unauthorized participant databases;</li>
    <li>use BBK participant information for purposes unrelated to legitimate Clinical Research recruitment and Study operations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>7. Recruitment and Preliminary Pre-Screening</h2>
  <p>BBK may use participant-provided information and Study-specific questions to conduct preliminary recruitment pre-screening.</p>
  <p>Preliminary pre-screening is intended to organize recruitment and referrals.</p>
  <p>It is not a clinical determination.</p>
  <p>Final Study eligibility is determined by the applicable Research Site.</p>

